   "type": "DOCUMENT",
   "isFreePreview": true,
   "description": "Khung môn học theo syllabus FLM chính thức.",
   "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">HOA102 · Section 0 · Lesson 0.3</span>\n<h2>The 8 course learning outcomes (CLO), verbatim</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">Exam questions are written against these outcomes — use them as your checklist.</p>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM · Syllabus ID 13352 · Decision 932/QĐ-ĐHFPT dated 22/08/2025 · collected 08/11/2026</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">HOA102 · Mục 0 · Bài 0.3</span>\n<h2>8 chuẩn đầu ra môn học (CLO), nguyên văn</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">Đề thi được ra theo các chuẩn đầu ra này — dùng chúng làm danh sách tự kiểm.</p>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: FLM · Syllabus ID 13352 · QĐ 932/QĐ-ĐHFPT ngày 22/08/2025 · thu ngày 08/11/2026</p></div>\n<table>\n  <thead><tr><th>#</th><th>CLO</th><th>Details (verbatim)<br><small>Nội dung (nguyên văn)</small></th></tr></thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr><td>1</td><td><strong>CLO1</strong></td><td>(Basic Knowledge) Summarize the development process of Art History; Identify and describe the major holdings related to fine art style and movement, avant-garde artists.</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>2</td><td><strong>CLO2</strong></td><td>(Research Skills) - Understand the context of the major styles and movements in Art History, in relation to socio-cultural, economic, political, religious..., talented and avant-garde artists.</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>3</td><td><strong>CLO3</strong></td><td>(Critical Thinking) Analyze and evaluate critically the meanings and descriptions of works of art from different periods of the past in Art History.</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>4</td><td><strong>CLO4</strong></td><td>(Communication Skills): Study optional cases in Art History, organize and express the individual thoughts clearly and coherently both in orally (presentations) and writing (assignments/essays).</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>5</td><td><strong>CLO5</strong></td><td>Be aware of what is aesthetics of visual art and understand the stages of aesthetic awareness in art history</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>6</td><td><strong>CLO6</strong></td><td>Evaluate manual and/or digital art works, media and materials appropriately to produce creative ways solutions for specific cultural and technical contexts.</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>7</td><td><strong>CLO7</strong></td><td>Having a professional style in arts activity. Love to research in art history.</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>8</td><td><strong>CLO8</strong></td><td>Students have a proficient in presentation and teamworks.</td></tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">Everything in the tables above is copied <strong>verbatim</strong> from the university's FLM page (in English, as published) so you can check it against the copy your lecturer gives you: <a href=\"https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=13352\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=13352</a> (needs your FPT login). If FLM publishes a newer syllabus, FLM wins.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">Mọi thứ trong các bảng trên được chép <strong>nguyên văn</strong> từ trang FLM của trường (bằng tiếng Anh, đúng như trường công bố) để bạn đối chiếu với bản giảng viên phát: <a href=\"https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=13352\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=13352</a> (cần đăng nhập tài khoản FPT). Nếu FLM công bố bản syllabus mới hơn thì theo FLM.</div></div>"
